    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your &quot;friends&quot; have been hired by a mysterious delivery company with one simple task: deliver the package. But there's a catch. Only <i>one</i> of you can deliver it and claim the cash. The rest? Well, they\u2019re just in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotage and Survive</strong> In this chaotic multiplayer game, you\u2019ll use proximity VOIP to communicate and <i>strategize</i> with your friends... or just lie. Pick up anything you find along the way\u2014rocks, bananas, or even more questionable objects\u2014and sabotage your friends by any means necessary. Only one of you walks away with the paycheck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying Bunker Runs</strong> These delivery locations aren\u2019t your usual drop-offs. Procedurally generated bunkers filled with unsettling creatures are waiting to turn your job into a nightmare. Stay quiet, stay alert, and keep an eye on your &quot;friends&quot;\u2014because the monsters aren\u2019t the only threat lurking in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take. Sell. Profit.</strong> Why just deliver the package when you can make some side cash? Collect valuable items along the way and sell them off for upgrades, traps, and more ways to make your &quot;friends&quot; miserable. The more you sabotage, the closer you get to that sweet payday.</p>",
